    "m_Notes": "AluminumPBR - Brushed aluminum material for CNC workpieces and machine surfaces. Uses anisotropic highlight approximation for brushed metal look. Metallic: 0.95, Smoothness: 0.7. Requires a brushed normal map texture for full effect. Fallback shader: MIRACLE/AluminumPBR (hand-written HLSL)."
